OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 29 DEC
OL,4,G1600FJamz Supernova's Teatime Session
OL,5,     GJamz covers during the weird week
OL,6,     Gbetween Christmas & New Year &
OL,7,     Ghas a Home Run at 5pm to add some
OL,8,     Gnormality to the week. Plus,
OL,9,     GEmily Pilbeam joins with ears on
OL,10,     Gan artist for 2026.
OL,11,G1900FIndie Forever Disco with Beth
OL,12,     FDitto
OL,13,     GBringing the club vibes to you -
OL,14,     Gwherever you are, whenever you
OL,15,     Gwant. Upbeat music to transport
OL,16,     Gyou to the dance floor from The
OL,17,     GKillers, Caribou and Felix Da
OL,18,     GHousecat.
OL,19,G2100FRiley & Coe
OL,20,     GA fantastic selection of the
OL,21,     Glad's favourite tunes and
OL,22,     Gsessions from the last year.
