OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 29 DEC
OL,4,G0200FDavid Bowie Live
OL,5,     GOn 27th June 2000, two days after
OL,6,     Gheadlining Glastonbury's Pyramid
OL,7,     GStage, David Bowie performed for
OL,8,     Ga small audience at the BBC's
OL,9,     GRadio Theatre in Broadcasting
OL,10,     GHouse in London.
OL,11,G0300FDavid Bowie Star Special
OL,12,     GDavid Bowie presents some of his
OL,13,     Gfavourite tracks, ranging from
OL,14,     GThe Velvet Underground to Elgar,
OL,15,     Gin a rarely-heard programme
OL,16,     Goriginally recorded in 1979.
OL,17,G0400FThe David Bowie Playlist
OL,18,     GA playlist celebrating the music
OL,19,     Gof David Bowie and its roots and
OL,20,     Gbranches - including artists he
OL,21,     Gadmired and some he's inspired.
